        // f[v][1] = pair (size, count) where size is max matching size in subtree v with v matched to a child, count is number of ways

        // For f[v][0]:
        //   For each child u, we choose the best option from f[u][0] and f[u][1]
        //   If both give the same size, we need to handle uniqueness carefully.
